 "notes": [
  "Attacks are shots: events.shot is when the bolt leaves (the action's shot_frame); from then the bolt is hidden (events.bolt_hidden, the Bolt bone at zero scale) until reload lays a new one on the rail. Every other clip shows the bolt on the rail.",
  "Locomotion is in place. walk moves the figure by root_vel (m/s, Godot axes): the travel crossbow_clips.py removed, measured again from the source clip (travel_from); speed_footlock_mps is how fast his planted foot slides back, a few percent slower (the retarget's stride is a little short). walk_stop is in place too: root_path ([x, z] per frame from the first) is the travel to add, ending at events.stopped; enter it from the walk at enter_walk_t. Its hips keep only the sway and end where idle's are. Deaths keep their authored travel on the hips (root_motion true, hips_drift); do not add it again.",
  "Skinning uses up to 8 bone influences per vertex (JOINTS_0 and JOINTS_1); four would move parts of the body by up to 5 cm.",
  "The capelet's CapeDropR shape key is a morph target whose weights are baked into every clip.",
  "The quiver is skinned to mixamorig:Spine2; the shoulder's DQS mix is left out (linear skinning only).",
  "Godot imports every clip with loop mode none; set it from clips.<clip>.loop. Animation names equal the clip names (clips.<clip>.anim)."
 ],
